# Issue #58: text files always use LF line endings, also on Windows (Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true,
# which gave index.html CRLF line endings there). Pictures and other binary files are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.avif binary
*.bmp binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.pdf binary
*.glb binary
